<section class="page-shell"><div class="page-header"><span class="eyebrow">Nervous System Regulation</span><h1>Mindfulness Corner</h1><p>Every feature here asks the same thing: does this help you shift safely from one state to another?</p></div>
  <div class="module-grid"><article class="card module-card"><span>01</span><h2>Insomnia / Rest Mode</h2><p>Nervous-system downshift, emotional unhooking and permission to rest when sleep does not arrive.</p><button class="button button-ghost mini-practice" data-practice="rest">Start 60-second downshift</button></article><article class="card module-card"><span>02</span><h2>Grounding</h2><p>Sensory anchoring and a calm 4–2–6 breath rhythm.</p><a class="button button-ghost" href="/rooms/ground">Open Ground Me</a></article><article class="card module-card"><span>03</span><h2>Silence Mode</h2><p>No guidance. No demand. Ambient visual quiet with one message: you don't have to do anything.</p><button class="button button-ghost mini-practice" data-practice="silence">Enter silence</button></article></div>
  <div id="practice-overlay" class="practice-overlay" hidden><button id="close-practice">Close</button><div><div class="slow-orb"></div><p id="practice-copy">You don't have to do anything.</p></div></div>
  <div class="two-column journal-section"><form method="post" action="/mindfulness/journal" class="card form-stack"><span class="eyebrow">Journaling System</span><h2>Place something here</h2><label>Journal pathway<select name="type"><option value="night">Night journaling</option><option value="release">Release journaling</option><option value="reflection">Reflection journaling</option></select></label><label>Mood<input type="range" min="1" max="5" value="3" name="mood"></label><label>What is your mind holding?<textarea name="content" rows="8" required></textarea></label><button class="button" type="submit">Save reflection</button></form><section class="journal-list"><% entries.forEach(e=>{ %><article class="card journal-card"><div class="section-heading"><span class="tag"><%= e.type %></span><small><%= new Date(e.createdAt).toLocaleString() %></small></div><p class="preserve-lines"><%= e.content %></p><% if(e.aiReflection){ %><div class="ai-reflection"><strong>AI Reflective Mirror</strong><p><%= e.aiReflection %></p></div><% } %></article><% }) %></section></div>
</section>
